{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bbb48f0f4132e74c03c504825fc45c13.avif?t=1756199993\" width=720 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Vextorial, you play as Pilo, a curious 2D being navigating a vast, ancient ruin suspended in constantly changing dimensions. As you journey through this surreal world, you\u2019ll swap between 2D and 3D perspectives, manipulate gravity to forge new paths, and solve mind-bending puzzles that defy conventional space. Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter a cast of strange and intriguing characters, each with their own perspective on this world, who will guide you on your quest to uncover the truth behind your lost memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e22149c6d56c503209fa7062d71b24c9.avif?t=1756199993\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken with no memory of who you are or why you\u2019ve come to this place, only that the world itself reacts to you in impossible ways. Planes rotate. Gravity bends. Walls become floors. Every step forward unravels another thread of a mystery hidden deep within the shifting geometry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/820e489b535ac9f2d39b94e860772522.avif?t=1756199993\" width=780 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twist and turn a surreal 3D world world from your 2D perspective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.poster.avif?t=1756199993\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.webm?t=1756199993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/da2065c924536b0cca3e7de1fa5150c3.mp4?t=1756199993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth cryptic fragments of memory and lost history\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.poster.avif?t=1756199993\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.webm?t=1756199993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/e59fb283c924b254cd6add3e8bb9e052.mp4?t=1756199993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shift gravity to forge impossible paths through space</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.poster.avif?t=1756199993\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.webm?t=1756199993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3068710/extras/bdeaa37e2a55de8183272ca480f268d2.mp4?t=1756199993\"